    "blog": "<h1><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Bill to Amend the National Health Act Not Focused on the Legislative Agenda</span></h1>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">House Bill 802, titled the National Health Act (Amendment) Bill, 2023, a bill sponsored by Hon. Adedayo Samuel Adesola which has scaled second reading and forwarded to the Committee on Healthcare Services for further consideration on Februrary, 5, 2025 is not related to the House commitment on increasing the funding for the BHCPF.&nbsp;</span></p>",
